    streetLevel: `Rosedale\'s tight inventory means listing strategy matters more than pricing precision here. If you\'re selling and you get more than one qualified buyer offer within the first week, you\'ve almost certainly priced correctly and can hold firm. If you don\'t, price is off — cut decisively rather than sit.\n\nOn the buy side, expect to see homes within 48 hours of listing and be ready to make a decision the same day. Rosedale doesn\'t have a "wait a week and think about it" market — well-priced homes are gone. Have your financing pre-underwritten (not just pre-qualified) before you start showings.`,
