    name: 'West Campus',
    fullName: 'West Campus',
    zip: '78705',
    city: 'Austin',
    lat: '30.2870',
    lng: '-97.7440',
    tagline: 'The condo-heavy neighborhood immediately west of UT Austin — a parent-buyer condo market with unique cash-heavy, rate-insensitive dynamics.',
    heroSub: 'Buy or sell a West Campus condo with a licensed Central Austin Realtor who understands the parent-buyer market, HOA transfer disclosures, and student-tenant investment math.',
    priceContext: '$250K to $500K for standard student condos; $600K to $900K for larger units or newer high-rise product.',
